<mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  css-class="border-line"
  padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="5px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;" color="#000000">
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 2px !important;">
    Ethnic policy shift
  </h2>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Ethnic policy shift"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>What’s happening?</strong> China's parliament is poised to pass a law on <a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c6271gxpdkzo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">promoting ethnic unity</a> and progress this week, formalizing aggressive assimilation policies under Xi Jinping. The legislation prioritizes Mandarin over minority languages in schools and official use, bans interference with inter-ethnic marriages, mandates parental guidance to support the ruling Chinese Communist Party, and prohibits acts harming ethnic unity.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Criticisms: </strong>China officially recognises 56 ethnicities (the Han majority and 55 minority groups), many of whom live in regions such as Xinjiang, Tibet, and Inner Mongolia. Human rights groups say the legislation could legitimize long-criticised policies, including limits on minority language education, tighter religious controls, and restrictions on expressions of ethnic identity. Beijing says the measure will advance modernization and unity by integrating ethnic minority regions more closely into national development.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Big picture:</strong> Analysts say the law reflects a broader shift under Xi toward stronger central control and a unified national identity. While authorities frame it as essential for stability and development, critics warn it could deepen grievances among minority communities and further entrench Beijing’s controversial “Sinicisation” policies in law.</p>
</mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-section
      background-color="#eff1f4"
      css-class="border-line"
      padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
      border-radius="5px"
    >
      <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
        <!-- long stroy short content sections -->
        <mj-text
          padding="16px 12px 10px 12px"
          font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
          color="white"
        >
          <h2
            style="
              padding-bottom: 8px;
              color: #4d3060;
              text-align: left;
              border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;

              font-size: 26px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Lebanon has called for direct negotiations with Israel to establish permanent arrangements for security and stability along their border,</strong> while accusing the Iran-backed Hezbollah of betraying the country’s interests. Beirut said Hezbollah’s involvement in regional conflicts had endangered Lebanon, urging an internationally backed truce, Israeli withdrawal from southern areas, and steps to disarm the group to stabilise the country (<a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/03/09/middleeast/lebanon-president-israel-talks-hezbollah-latam-intl" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Lebanon blames Hezbollah</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>G7 nations declared readiness to take necessary measures, including potential stockpile releases, to support global energy supplies</strong>. A meeting with finance ministers and the IEA ended without agreeing to tap 1.2Bn barrels of emergency reserves. The International Energy Agency warned that disrupted production and halted tanker traffic through the Strait of Hormuz are increasing risks to global oil supply (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c79542n0grwo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">supply safeguards</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Anthropic sued the US Department of Defense over its blacklist, which designated it a supply-chain risk for refusing to lift AI restrictions</strong> on autonomous weapons and surveillance. The company argues the designation is unlawful and violates constitutional rights amid threats to revenue and government contracts (<a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/mar/09/anthropic-defense-department-lawsuit-ai" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Anthropic challenges blacklist</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Airlines launched broader fare hikes amid a jet fuel surge to $150-$200 per barrel from the US-Israel-Iran war,</strong> with Air New Zealand raising domestic fares by NZ$10 and long-haul by NZ$90 while suspending its 2026 outlook. Airline shares stabilized after Trump's comments eased oil prices to $90/barrel, lifting carriers like Korean Air and Qantas (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/markets/airlines-begin-to-hike-fares-due-to-higher-fuel-prices-shares-stabilise/ar-AA1XRSLG?ocid=finance-verthp-feeds" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Airlines hike fares</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>German publishers and advertisers rejected Apple's proposed changes to its App Tracking Transparency rules, </strong>urging the antitrust authority to impose a fine and halt the tool. The groups, including the German Advertising Federation, argued that the changes fail to address market power abuses, keeping Apple as a "data gatekeeper" that controls access to ad tracking despite proposed neutral prompts and simplified consents (<a href="https://telecom.economictimes.indiatimes.com/amp/news/mvas-apps/german-publishers-demand-severe-action-against-apple-over-antitrust-violations-in-app-tracking/129368978" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Germany targets Apple</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Astronomers using the Hobby-Eberly Telescope Dark Energy Experiment have created the most detailed 3D map of the early universe, </strong>revealing hidden galaxies and gas clouds from 9-11Bn years ago. Using Line Intensity Mapping to track Lyman-alpha radiation from hydrogen, researchers analysed hundreds of minutes of spectra to detect the faint glow of distant objects, offering fresh insights into galaxy formation and cosmic structure (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260308201557.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">cosmic 3D map</a>)</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>X says users can block its Grok chatbot from editing photos they upload to the platform.</strong> A new toggle in the iOS app’s image settings allows people to prevent Grok from modifying a post’s image through tagged replies. However, the control has limitations: images can still be edited using other Grok tools, such as saving and re-uploading the photo for modification (<a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/891352/x-grok-xai-edit-blocker-photo-toggle" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Grok edit block</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Australia grants humanitarian visas to five Iranian women’s footballers (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/03/09/sport/australia-iran-women-soccer-asian-cup-intl-hnk" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">visa granted</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Live Nation Entertainment avoids breakup in major antitrust case (<a href="https://www.nbcnews.com/business/consumer/ticketmaster-live-nation-settles-antitrust-case-rcna262392" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">bid fails</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Researchers link the keto diet to improved exercise response (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260308201620.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">endurance boost</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Ukrainian athlete says ChatGPT served as a coach and a psychologist during Paralympic victory (<a href="https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/mar/09/ukraine-winter-paralympics-chat-gpt-artificial-intelligence" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">AI coach</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/03/09/politics/trump-afghanistan-state-sponsor-wrongful-detention" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">The Trump administration adds Afghanistan to the wrongful detention sponsor list.</a></p>
</mj-text>

